5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried the flat fee hides real costs. Who pays if someone cancels last minute?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I worry about the quiet corners. If we stay too close, the year-groups might not mix at all.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to know how much time the organizers actually lose to logistics. Last year’s duty schedule was unsustainable.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I want to know what the nights and days would actually be like. Last camp, half of us slept terribly for four nights straight.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I need to trace where the money actually went last year. The account gap is still there, and I won’t repeat that mistake.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
